  "Question": "A spring has an original length of 10 cm and stretches by 0.5 cm for every 1 kg of mass hung from it. What is the spring's length in cm when a 6 kg object is hung from it?",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "13",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The length is $y=10+0.5x$. When $x=6$, $y=10+3=13$.",
